u0000\u0000\u0000\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u000f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u000f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u000f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0010\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0010\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0010\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0010\u0000\u0000\u0000\u000f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u000f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u000f\u0000\u0000\u00004\u0000\u0000\u00004\u0000\u0000\u0000\u00f6\u00ff3\u0001\u00e8\u0001Designed around the new"
    },
    {
      "type": "ascii",
      "start": 783,
      "end": 1248,
      "text": " Rotary Autocannon, this 'Mech harkens back to the days of the Star Leauge with it armourment. This mech, although armed with different weapons, is very similar in design astectics to the venerable Annihilator Battlemech. With five tons of ammo for the Rotary Autocannons, this mech has enough firepower to stop almost anything dead in it's tracks. A lighter mech has been designed using the smaller class of the new Autocannon, and it has met with marked results. "
    },
    {
      "type": "len_string",
      "start": 1248,
      "end": 1743,
      "length": 493,
      "text": "Able to cover great distances in a relatively short time, the Demolisher is a assault mech personified. When the Autocannons are fired with only single rounds, the weapon has no more damage potential than a standard LB-5x Autocannon, but when the pilots select four or six barrels, the damage is increased significantly, even with the massive drain this puts on the ammo bins, there is enough to sustain two minutes of continuos fire, more then enough to reduce any mech to a smouldering hulk."
    },
